Aku bangga padamu, sayang.

00:48:50.823 --> 00:48:52.490
Maafkan aku, Doris.

00:48:52.992 --> 00:48:54.826
Sungguh.

00:49:02.627 --> 00:49:06.171
Dia telah berubah./
Dia cuma anak...

00:49:06.339 --> 00:49:08.423
