00:53:17.756 --> 00:53:18.840
Danny, tiarap!

00:53:20.342 --> 00:53:23.094
Jangan, Danny!

00:53:24.388 --> 00:53:25.597
Ibu!

00:53:39.361 --> 00:53:41.571
Negro, kau salah cari musuh.

00:53:41.739 --> 00:53:43.781
Kemari!/ Lepaskan!

00:53:43.949 --> 00:53:47.410
